  "problem": "$$\n{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,-1)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{24}{7{x}^{4}}, & \\,1\\le x\\le 2 \\\\ 0, & \\,\\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $X$ and $Y$ be continuous random variables. \nFind the conditional variance $\\text{Var}[X\\,|\\,Y=-1]$ given that the conditional probability density function ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,-1)$ is shown above and the corresponding expected value is ${\\mu }_{X|-1}=\\frac{9}{7}.$",
